{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Mercie, a modern witch with ancient powers and zero motivation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/f39cc91b1f45091fdb0e8e5770807242.poster.avif?t=1759345571\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/f39cc91b1f45091fdb0e8e5770807242.webm?t=1759345571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/f39cc91b1f45091fdb0e8e5770807242.mp4?t=1759345571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'd rather scroll memes all day, but disaster strikes - her beloved phone dies! No gold, no backup and no tech support... What will she do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answer: Brew a brand new phone in her cauldron!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/0efaa8794c246cb80b13534df281c446.avif?t=1759345571\" width=1549 height=401 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this incremental idle game, brew up chaos in your cauldron of everything as you summon hard-working fairies to do the dirty work while Mercie chills. Throw random resources into your cauldron and watch it cook and churn out more resources, upgrades and bizarre surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you brew, the more wonderful things get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/43dcbfc3642947f1f5c2634fd5521a4b.poster.avif?t=1759345571\" width=958 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/43dcbfc3642947f1f5c2634fd5521a4b.webm?t=1759345571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/43dcbfc3642947f1f5c2634fd5521a4b.mp4?t=1759345571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highlights:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Idle-Cooking Gameplay</strong>!<br>Brew bizarre items in your cauldron, summon helpful fairies and let them do all the hard work for you while you chill </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon an Army of Fairy Workers</strong>! <br>They're cute. They're fast. These little helpers automatically gather  resources for your cauldron!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Everything</strong>!<br>Speed up your fairies, unlock more efficient recipes and automate your lovely fairies and your cauldron</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expect the Unexpected</strong>!<br>Unlock new zones and navigate the everyday chaos of witch life<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/681600800a751b145f7216899d8018fb.poster.avif?t=1759345571\" width=944 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/681600800a751b145f7216899d8018fb.webm?t=1759345571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/681600800a751b145f7216899d8018fb.mp4?t=1759345571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So grab your wand, fire up the cauldron and get ready to scroll your way through magical chaos!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053840?t=1759345571","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053840?t=1759345571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/9a4dc35a3f8ab36adb3dc1ba1890fca22194f815/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759345571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/9a4dc35a3f8ab36adb3dc1ba1890fca22194f815/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759345571","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Mercie, a modern witch with ancient powers and zero motivation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/f39cc91b1f45091fdb0e8e5770807242.poster.avif?t=1759345571\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/f39cc91b1f45091fdb0e8e5770807242.webm?t=1759345571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053840/extras/f39cc91b1f45091fdb0e8e5770807242.mp4?t=1759345571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'd rather scroll memes all day, but disaster strikes - her beloved phone dies! No gold, no backup and no tech support... What will she do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answer: Brew a brand new phone in her cauldron!</p><